<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.cabal.feeds ~ the offering that keeps a realm alive

`lares cabal feed realm=<id>` rolls the acting face's own maintenance-feed slot in the realm; a face feeds, never a device, and feeding twice rolls twice, so the clock measures how hard each hand feeds. Two members feeding at once never clobber each other or move the admission lease.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ feed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`feed` params=`realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef ~ make the offering`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ realm · nexus · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/doc-id needs/required ~ the cabal-realm doc id, 64 hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus at this vessel's first act in the realm; the ledger keeps it after`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-at-nexus ~ the store door acts as the face, its key at the realm's Nexus`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · CabalFaceError · store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.cabal.feeds realm/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef]] ~ realm= expects a 64-hex cabal-realm doc id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`CabalFaceError` params=`~ the face holds no key at the realm's Nexus`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused, or no vessel answers; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ fed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`fed` params=`exit/0 ~ the slot rolled; the clock reads it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

